    <item>
      <title>Game Boy on chain</title>
      <link>https://gameboyonchain.dev-dot.li</link>
      <description>Twenty Game Boy Color homebrew cartridges, emulated in the page — nothing is fetched from anywhere else. Every one carries an explicit licence permitting redistribution: MIT, Zlib, Apache-2.0, GPL and CC-BY-SA. Titles include Tobu Tobu Girl Deluxe, Dawn Will Come, GB Corp., uCity and Geometrix. Author, licence and source are shown on each game screen; the copyleft titles link the corresponding source as their licence requires. Browse the whole handheld, then pick a cartridge and it scales up to play.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">gameboyonchain</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 13:01:24 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>NES on chain</title>
      <link>https://nesonchain.dev-dot.li</link>
      <description>Fifteen freely-licensed NES homebrew games, emulated in the page — nothing is fetched from anywhere else and nothing you press leaves it. Every title ships its author&apos;s own release build under an SPDX licence that permits redistribution: MIT, Zlib, Unlicense and GPL-3.0. Author, licence and source repository are shown on each game screen, and the GPL titles link the corresponding source as the licence requires.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">nesonchain</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 09:55:00 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
